    <div class="panel mt-12" style="padding:var(--space-6)">
      <span class="label">Accessibility rules</span>
      <ul class="rule-list mt-4" style="columns:2;column-gap:var(--space-12)">
        <li>Meaningful images carry descriptive <span class="mono">alt</span> text.</li>
        <li>Decorative images use empty <span class="mono">alt=""</span>.</li>
        <li>Figures include captions when context isn't obvious.</li>
        <li>Charts &amp; diagrams provide a text summary and key values.</li>
